@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam defaultFontColor #1e293b
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam arrowColor #2563eb
skinparam arrowThickness 2
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #f8fafc
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #fffbeb
skinparam NoteBorderColor #f59e0b
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #94a3b8
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #f8fafc

title MSL Key Exchange 两条路线对比

participant "Client" as C
participant "RSA / Software Crypto" as RSA
participant "Widevine CDM" as CDM
participant "Netflix MSL Server" as N

== Web / Rave / Chrome JSON: ASYMMETRIC_WRAPPED ==

group ASYMMETRIC_WRAPPED
  C -> RSA : Generate RSA-2048 keypair
  C -> N : Handshake\nentityauthdata=NONE\nkeyrequestdata=RSA public key
  N --> C : MasterToken\nRSA-wrapped JWK encryptionkey/hmackey
  C -> RSA : RSA-OAEP decrypt JWK
  RSA --> C : Plain AES key + HMAC key
end

note over C,RSA
  优点: 独立、软件可控、容易调试。
  限制: Web/Cadmium 路线通常受画质策略约束。
end note

== Android / Hearo / MslClient: WIDEVINE ==

group WIDEVINE / WIDEVINE_APPID
  C -> CDM : MediaDrm.openSession()
  C -> CDM : getKeyRequest(initData,\n"application/xml", OFFLINE)
  CDM --> C : Widevine challenge
  C -> N : Handshake\nentityauthdata=WIDEVINE_APPID\nkeyrequestdata=challenge
  N --> C : MasterToken\ncdmkeyresponse + encryptionkeyid/hmackeyid
  C -> CDM : provideKeyResponse(cdmkeyresponse)
  CDM --> C : CryptoSession keys installed
end

note over C,CDM
  优点: 接近官方 Android 链路, 可借真实设备能力。
  难点: 密钥不一定导出, 需要 CryptoSession.encrypt/sign/decrypt 作为 oracle。
end note

== After Handshake ==

C -> C : Build encrypted headerdata + payload
C -> N : mastertoken + encrypted header + payload + HMAC
N --> C : encrypted MSL response

@enduml
